# This is a monorepo; EAS Build for the `mobile/` app only needs that
# directory. Everything else here (other services, ML assets, generated
# video/render output, reference docs) is irrelevant to the mobile build
# and was pushing the upload archive to 7+ GB (limit is 2 GB). EAS looks
# for .easignore at the git root, not inside mobile/, so it has to live
# here rather than in mobile/.easignore.
#
# IMPORTANT: EAS CLI's Ignore class stops reading .gitignore entirely the
# moment ANY .easignore exists (see eas-cli/build/vcs/local.js) -- it does
# not merge the two. So every path .gitignore used to exclude for this
# project has to be re-listed here explicitly, or it gets uploaded raw.
# This matters a lot for mobile/android: it holds local native build
# caches (Gradle, CMake/.cxx) with this machine's absolute paths baked
# into cached CMake metadata -- uploading that stale, foreign-path cache
# to EAS's Linux build server is suspected of corrupting its Gradle
# configure step (a native module's project directory going "missing").

mobile/android/app/build
mobile/android/app/.cxx
mobile/android/build
mobile/android/.gradle
mobile/ios

.agents
.claude
.github
.impeccable
.logs
.stitch
.tunnel_logs
